2:T767,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does kitchen fitting cost in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, fitting labour for a small or medium kitchen may typically cost around £3,000–£8,000. Every project differs, and the final quote depends on the layout, services, materials, appliances and preparation required. Request a free quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a kitchen fitting price include the cabinets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Many kitchen fitting prices cover installation labour but exclude the cost of cabinets, worktops, appliances, tiles and flooring. Check the written quote carefully."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to fit a kitchen from flat-pack units?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, installing flat-pack or assembled cabinets may typically cost £1,000–£3,000 for a small to medium kitchen, before worktops, appliances, plumbing, electrics and finishing work. Every project differs, so request a free quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the most expensive part of kitchen fitting?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The largest costs can vary by project. Cabinet installation, worktops, electrical alterations and layout changes can be significant, while premium worktops and moving plumbing or appliances can increase the quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I get an accurate kitchen fitting price?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Provide measurements, plans, appliance details and photos, then request a written quote listing inclusions and exclusions. An on-site assessment can be helpful where services or the room condition are uncertain. BMB Renovation offers free, no-obligation quotes."}}]}7:["slug","kitchen-fitting-price-list","d"]
9:T4d5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HomeAndConstructionBusiness","name":"BMB Renovation","url":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk","logo":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/favicon.svg","image":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/og-image.png","description":"BMB Renovation offers premium home, kitchen & bathroom renovation services in Watford, London & Hertfordshire. 15+ years of experience. Free consultation.","telephone":"+447775758717","email":"contact@bmbrenovation.co.uk","priceRange":"££","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"157 Judge Street","addressLocality":"Watford","postalCode":"WD24 5AN","addressRegion":"Hertfordshire","addressCountry":"GB"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":51.6549,"longitude":-0.3978},"areaServed":["Watford","Bushey","Rickmansworth","St Albans","Hemel Hempstead","Borehamwood","Harrow","Croxley Green","Luton","Bedford","London"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"},{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":"Saturday","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/bmbrenovation","https://www.instagram.com/bmbrenovation"]}0:["OXaFT9SKmK3rhYCPd5ArS",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","kitchen-fitting-price-list","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"kitchen-fitting-price-list\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","kitchen-fitting-price-list","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen flex flex-col","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Kitchen Fitting Price List: UK Costs Explained\",\"description\":\"Kitchen fitting price list for UK homeowners: see rough costs for cabinets, worktops, plumbing, electrics, tiling and complete kitch